of the game?

00:45:44.050 --> 00:45:45.390
AUDIENCE: Yes.

00:45:45.390 --> 00:45:47.940
GUEST SPEAKER: So now, if you
know that that's his daughter,

00:45:47.940 --> 00:45:50.020
what do you think it's about?

00:45:50.020 --> 00:45:51.680
AUDIENCE: Neglect.

00:45:51.680 --> 00:45:55.550
AUDIENCE: Job versus family.

00:45:55.550 --> 00:45:57.860
GUEST SPEAKER: He says
explicitly, before you play,

00:45:57.860 --> 00:45:59.350
