telling you what the game is

00:46:03.090 --> 00:46:04.000
specifically about.

00:46:04.000 --> 00:46:05.260
I think playing through
it a couple times--

00:46:05.260 --> 00:46:09.350
I will tell you the first time
I played and I came back down

00:46:09.350 --> 00:46:12.070
and she was gone, it was
very upsetting for me.

00:46:12.070 --> 00:46:17.540
I was like, and I don't know
if it's just I was ready to

00:46:17.540 --> 00:46:20.510
