stage or something like that.

00:46:20.510 --> 00:46:23.647
But the idea of he's playing
with his daughter, that

00:46:23.647 --> 00:46:26.700
inspires him, he travels, and
then one of these days if

00:46:26.700 --> 00:46:29.530
you're gone too long,
she grows up.

00:46:29.530 --> 00:46:31.330
I don't know if she
dies, but--

00:46:31.330 --> 00:46:34.650
