00:49:50.730 --> 00:49:51.160
GUEST SPEAKER: This--

00:49:51.160 --> 00:49:52.156
[INAUDIBLE]

00:49:52.156 --> 00:49:53.650
Natural Climate [INAUDIBLE].

00:50:02.116 --> 00:50:03.366
AUDIENCE: Oh, I get it.

00:50:19.580 --> 00:50:20.550
That's fun.

00:50:20.550 --> 00:50:21.940
Is that the entire game?

00:50:21.940 --> 00:50:23.805
GUEST SPEAKER: Yes, that
