AUDIENCE: Do it.

00:55:10.022 --> 00:55:11.274
AUDIENCE: Do it.

00:55:11.274 --> 00:55:12.540
AUDIENCE: Do it.

00:55:12.540 --> 00:55:14.351
AUDIENCE: You're just gonna have
