Just that little--

00:55:52.550 --> 00:55:53.800
AUDIENCE: What are the
controls for this?

00:56:06.963 --> 00:56:07.957
AUDIENCE: You should disobey.

00:56:07.957 --> 00:56:09.245
AUDIENCE: What?

00:56:09.245 --> 00:56:11.504
Can you no longer jump?

00:56:11.504 --> 00:56:12.496
AUDIENCE: I'm just
